{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08977","headline":"扈亭西陂燕赏 · 韦应物","name":"扈亭西陂燕赏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杲杲朝阳时，悠悠清陂望。\n嘉树始氤氲，春游方浩荡。\n况逢文翰侣，爱此孤舟漾。\n绿野际遥波，横云分叠嶂。\n公堂日爲倦，幽襟自兹旷。\n有酒今满盈，愿君尽弘量。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08977.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08977","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}